@startuml cgms_fta
title Fault Tree Analysis – Incorrect Glucose Value

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "Incorrect\nGlucose Value" as TOP

component "Sensor Failure" as S1
component "Signal Processing Error" as S2
component "Calibration Error" as S3
component "Communication Failure" as S4

TOP --> S1
TOP --> S2
TOP --> S3
TOP --> S4

component "Enzyme Degradation" as S1a
component "Temperature Drift" as S1b

S1 --> S1a
S1 --> S1b

component "Filter Misconfiguration" as S2a
component "ADC Saturation" as S2b

S2 --> S2a
S2 --> S2b

component "User Skipped Calibration" as S3a
component "Bad Reference Value" as S3b

S3 --> S3a
S3 --> S3b

component "BLE Packet Loss" as S4a
component "Data Corruption" as S4b

S4 --> S4a
S4 --> S4b

note bottom of TOP
Risk Control Examples:
- Range checks
- Rate-of-change limits
- CRC + retries
- Sensor expiration enforcement
end note

@enduml
